# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EarningHub — environment reference
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Never commit real values.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Build-time (public — baked into the static bundle) ──────────────────────
# Backend runner the static site calls. Default: https://workflows.zite.com
VITE_ZITE_RUNNER_URL=https://workflows.zite.com
# Public base path. "/" for a custom domain, "/Earninghub/" for github.io project pages.
VITE_BASE_PATH=/

# ── Server-side only (set in the Zite project → Environment variables) ──────
# REQUIRED by every admin endpoint. The server FAILS CLOSED when it is unset.
# Use a long random value (e.g. `openssl rand -base64 24`). Never put it in this repo.
# ZITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
